        "intro": "A hiring business can use this service quote comparison to connect included hours, management, tools, taxes, replacement terms, overtime, credits, and exclusions before a Philippines-based assistant receives production responsibility. The useful output is a source-linked operating packet with a named reviewer, explicit stop rules, and a verifiable finish state. The assistant may prepare and reconcile facts, while consequential decisions stay with the business owner.",
